% test: head_pair_constant_to_integer
% expected: fail (the input's type is not within the output's)
% description: A variable copied within a head must have its input's type
%   within its output's (TGLP b927b41, Definition "Well-Typed Clause with
%   Subtyping", clause (a)).  Copying a Constant input to an Integer output
%   is refused: Constant is not a subtype of Integer.  Positive twin:
%   positive/subtyping/head_pair_integer_to_constant.glp.

procedure elem(Constant?, Integer).
elem(X, X?).
